<title>CHINA: TABLE-JCG Holdings interim net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-JCG Holdings interim net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   30.3	 vs 26.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.5	  vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  17.42 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    216.99     vs 190.55 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		 JCG Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 11-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 29</p>
<p>NOTE - JCG Holdings owns JCG Finance Co, a deposit-taking company.</p>
<p>Comparative figures have been restated to reflect a change in accounting policy of a subsidiary, resulting in a reduction of HK$1.9 million in the comparison's net profit figure.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represented loss from sale of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
